{%- comment -%}
  MANUALLY RESEARCHED STREET ADDRESSES
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  An override layer for gyms with no "a" (address) field in tjjm-gyms.json.
  Deliberately kept separate: the main dataset is never edited, so this file can
  be deleted at any time and the site silently reverts to "City, ST".

  FORMAT   one record per line:  ~Exact gym name|Street address
  The name must match the "n" value in tjjm-gyms.json EXACTLY, including case and
  punctuation. A mismatch just misses silently - the gym keeps its city-only line.

  PRECEDENCE   an address in tjjm-gyms.json always wins over this file. If the full
  Google Places enrichment is run later, these entries are superseded automatically
  and this file can simply be removed.

  Source-verified 28 July 2026 against Yelp business listings, official gym sites,
  Waze / Apple Maps place records, Fresha and chamber-of-commerce entries.
  70 gyms across 17 metros.

  DELIBERATELY EXCLUDED. A wrong address on a public directory is worse than none,
  so a gym was skipped whenever:
    - one listing covers several locations (Modern Martial Arts NYC, Ares BJJ)
    - sources disagreed (Derby City MMA: 8021 vs 2081 Dixie Hwy;
      Lucas Lepri Charlotte: Sardis Rd N vs Monroe Rd;
      Halifax BJJ vs Halifax BJJ Society: two names, two addresses, unclear pairing)
    - the address found sits in a different city than our data records
      (Supreme Academy ATX is in Kyle; Minnesota Martial Arts Academy is in
      Brooklyn Center; both would produce misleading map links)
    - the match was simply not certain (Jon Calestine, Capital City BJJ, N-Flux)

  5 Aug 2026 (Washington run): one entry added for a COLLISION, not a missing address.
  "Bellingham BJJ" exists in both the legacy data and MatMade. Suppressing the legacy
  copy via wa_removed would have killed the MatMade copy too, because the section
  matches removals on the exact name. So the legacy record is kept, the MatMade
  duplicate was never imported, and its street address is supplied here instead.

  5 Aug 2026 (Oregon run): same pattern, but found by DOMAIN rather than by name.
  Legacy "Ashland BJJ" and MatMade "Ashland Jiu-jitsu Academy" are the same school —
  different names, same ashlandbjj.com, same city. The name-only collision check could
  not see it. Legacy record kept, MatMade duplicate never imported, address supplied here.
